{"baseRefName":"main","body":"SSG apps returned Home HTML when previewing `/about`, even though the build generated `about/index.html`. Hydration could hide the incorrect initial document.\n\nResolve existing prerendered directory indexes before Vite's HTML fallback. Keep route URLs and queries intact and let Vite serve the files with its existing headers, cache validation, and file precedence. Restrict resolution to HTML GET and HEAD requests within the resolved client output and install it only when prerendering is enabled.\n\nPatch the plugin and generator's bundled package snapshot without changing the public API or generated output layout.\n\nFixes #1811.\n","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOO_Rxb88AAAABgJpiyQ","author":{"login":"artile"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"**Validation:** Real-HTTP preview tests cover initial route and query HTML, HEAD, base and output overrides, file and proxy precedence, disabled prerendering, malformed paths, and symlink containment. The rebuilt packed generator passed initial-response assertions and existing SSR/SSG Chromium hydration and interaction checks; disabling the rewrite made the About-response assertion fail.\n\n`pnpm pre-push` passed locally with a 4 GB Node heap, one website browser worker, and system Chromium, including all 18 website browser tests. Plugin tests passed with 356 tests and 4 existing skips; plugin typecheck, package builds, script checks, and the copied reproduction also passed.\n\nPermanent packed-scaffold response assertions are a separate follow-up after this change merges. Deployed hosts and non-Chromium browsers were not tested.\n","createdAt":"2026-10-27T20:17:53Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/foldkit/foldkit/pull/1814#issuecomment-6452568777","viewerDidAuthor":true}],"headRefOid":"b3652ed9079de2d9c96c17a5d13f41d4e694ebaf","isDraft":true,"mergeStateStatus":"BLOCKED","reviewDecision":"","statusCheckRollup":[